<title>FRANCE: Air France pilots could suspend strike - union.</title>
<headline>Air France pilots could suspend strike - union.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-03-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>A meeting of Air France unions due on Friday could decide to suspend strike plans after progress was made in all night talks between management and pilots' unions, Geoffroy Bouvet, head of the SNPL pilots' union, told Reuters.</p>
<p>&quot;We will present the progress made overnight and it is possible that the whole general assembly will decide that it is enough to suspend the strike,&quot; he said.</p>
<p>Trade unions had called for a strike from March 23 to 26.</p>
</text>
